"id":"gwr-nonstationarity-test","derivation":"curated","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{observedStandardDeviation}{s_k}&=\\operatorname{sd}_i\\,\\beta_{ik},\n&\\term{simulatedMean}{\\bar s_k}&=\\frac{1}{P}\\sum_{p=1}^{P}s_k^{(p)}\\\\\n\\term{exceedances}{g_k}&=\\#\\{p:\\ s_k^{(p)}\\ge s_k\\},\n&\\term{pseudoPValue}{p_k}&=\\frac{g_k+1}{\\term{permutationCount}{P}+1}\\\\\n\\term{zSimulated}{z_k}&=\\frac{s_k-\\bar s_k}{\\term{simulatedDeviation}{\\sigma_{s_k}}}\n\\end{aligned}","ascii":"s_k = population standard deviation of the local estimates beta_ik over the tracts with a finite fit. Permutation p relabels (X, y) among the tracts with a keyed swap-or-not shuffle, refits every tract at the bandwidth already selected on the observed data, and records s_k^(p). g_k = number of permutations with s_k^(p) >= s_k; pseudo p = (g_k + 1)/(P + 1); z_k = (s_k - mean of s_k^(p))/sd of s_k^(p). Failed permuted fits are left out and counted.","symbols":[{"id":"observedStandardDeviation","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:observed"},{"id":"simulatedMean","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:mean"},{"id":"exceedances","role":"intermediate","binding":"wgsl:greater"},{"id":"pseudoPValue","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:table"},{"id":"permutationCount","role":"parameter","label":"permutations P","binding":"wgsl:permutationCount"},{"id":"zSimulated","role":"output","binding":"wgsl:simulatedDeviation"},{"id":"simulatedDeviation","role":"intermediate","binding":"wgsl:simulatedDeviation"}]}],"sources":[]},"decisions":[],"choices":[{"name":"permutations","stage":"inference","sweepable":true,"value":99},{"name":"seed","stage":"inference","sweepable":false,"value":1},{"name":"bandwidthPolicy","label":"Bandwidth in permutations","stage":"neighbourhood","sweepable":false,"value":"fixed at the bandwidth selected on the observed data"},{"name":"sampleTractCount","stage":"presentation","sweepable":false,"value":788},{"name":"droppedTractCount","stage":"presentation","sweepable":false,"value":3},{"name":"coordinateModel","stage":"presentation","sweepable":false,"value":"projected"},{"name":"distanceFrame","stage":"presentation","sweepable":false,"value":"azimuthal equidistant, origin -87.65 41.84, metres"},{"name":"pCorrection","stage":"presentation","sweepable":false,"value":"none"}],"captures":{"schema":"luma.computation-captures/1","runId":"run-196a3038","snapshots":[{"id":"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-snapshots-observedStandardDeviation-0","name":"observedStandardDeviation","iteration":0,"elementType":"f32","values":"b64:RFVlQM9jZD11gYc9pqknPg==","provenance":"gpu-readback","graph":"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled","resource":"observedStandardDeviation","meaning":"observedStandardDeviation; rows: intercept, poverty150Pct, noVehiclePct, uninsuredPct","role":"output","keySpace":"coefficient"},{"id":"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-snapshots-pseudoPValue-0","name":"pseudoPValue","iteration":0,"elementType":"f32","values":"b64:CtcjPI/C9TwK1yM8CtcjPA==","provenance":"gpu-readback","graph":"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled","resource":"pseudoPValue","meaning":"pseudoPValue; rows: intercept, poverty150Pct, noVehiclePct, uninsuredPct","role":"output","keySpace":"coefficient"},{"id":"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-snapshots-simulatedMean-0","name":"simulatedMean","iteration":0,"elementType":"f32","values":"b64:f0i8P3dQQD1c0lI9czPZPQ==","provenance":"gpu-readback","graph":"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled","resource":"simulatedMean","meaning":"simulatedMean; rows: intercept, poverty150Pct, noVehiclePct, uninsuredPct","role":"output","keySpace":"coefficient"},{"id":"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-snapshots-zSimulated-0","name":"zSimulate